that the event of the main bridi is before, simultaneous with, or after the=
 event given by the sumti (which is generally a =93le nu=94 abstraction; se=
e <a href=3D"../../11/1/">Chapter 11</a>).</p>
+<p>The tense and modal systems of Lojban interact with the logical connect=
